WEBVTT

00:05:30.663 --> 00:05:33.371
It deals with communication,
it deals with understanding,

00:05:33.413 --> 00:05:36.204
it deals with gaze,
it deals with attention.

00:05:36.246 --> 00:05:39.079
All of these things together
allow that interaction

00:05:39.121 --> 00:05:40.913
and our robots to be smart.

00:05:40.954 --> 00:05:43.163
These are just some 
of the tools we use

00:05:43.204 --> 00:05:45.454
in order to make robots smarter.

00:05:45.496 --> 00:05:47.621
So, I want to leave you with one thought.

00:05:47.663 --> 00:05:50.788
So, I'm all for robots and smart robots.

00:05:50.829 --> 00:05:52.038
I mean, that's what I do,

00:05:52.079 --> 00:05:54.329
I'd be out of a job
if I didn't believe in that.

00:05:54.371 --> 00:05:56.246
But yet, where does it end?

00:05:56.288 --> 00:05:57.579
How far do we push it?

00:05:57.621 --> 00:06:01.788
How far and how smart
should we make our smart robots?